<title identifier="/us/usc/t99"><num value="99">Title 99</num><heading>Invented</heading>
<section identifier="/us/usc/t99/s1"><num value="1">§ 1.</num><heading>Gadgets</heading>
<subsection identifier="/us/usc/t99/s1/a"><num value="a">(a)</num><chapeau>A gadget is—</chapeau>
<paragraph identifier="/us/usc/t99/s1/a/1"><num value="1">(1)</num><content>small;</content></paragraph>
<continuation>and, in either case,</continuation>
<paragraph identifier="/us/usc/t99/s1/a/2"><num value="2">(2)</num><content>light,</content></paragraph>
<continuation>unless the owner says otherwise.</continuation>
</subsection>
<subsection identifier="/us/usc/t99/s1/b"><num value="b">(b)</num><content>The first rule applies.<continuation>The second rule follows it.</continuation>A third rule ends it.</content></subsection>
